<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://catarinamidoes.pt/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://catarinamidoes.pt/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-11-22T20:14:01+00:00</updated><id>https://catarinamidoes.pt/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>Catarina Midões is a postdoctoral researcher at the CMCC, working on the impacts of heat on vulnerable populations, local heat adaptation policy, and climate shelter networks in Europe.</subtitle><entry><title type="html">mappatura dei rifugi climatici in Italia · mapping climate shelters in Italy</title><link href="https://catarinamidoes.pt/blog/2026/mappatura-rifugi-climatici/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="mappatura dei rifugi climatici in Italia · mapping climate shelters in Italy"/><published>2026-11-22T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-22T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://catarinamidoes.pt/blog/2026/mappatura-rifugi-climatici</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://catarinamidoes.pt/blog/2026/mappatura-rifugi-climatici/"><![CDATA[<style>
  .lang-switch { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--global-theme-color, #b509ac); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .lang-switch button { background: none; border: 0; padding: 0.25rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--global-theme-color, #b509ac); cursor: pointer; }
  .lang-switch button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--global-theme-color, #b509ac); color: var(--global-bg-color, #fff); }
  html[data-lang="it"] .lang-en, html[data-lang="en"] .lang-it { display: none; }
  html:not([data-lang]) .lang-switch { display: none; }
</style> <div class="lang-switch" role="group" aria-label="Lingua · Language"> <button type="button" data-set-lang="it" aria-pressed="false">IT</button> <button type="button" data-set-lang="en" aria-pressed="false">EN</button> </div> <div class="lang-it" lang="it"> <p>In collaborazione con ANCI (Associazione Nazionale dei Comuni Italiani), stiamo mappando le iniziative di rifugi climatici nei comuni italiani, combinando la ricerca sui siti web comunali con un questionario.</p> <h2 id="i-comuni">i comuni</h2> <p>Ad oggi abbiamo individuato 187 comuni con un’iniziativa di rifugi climatici attiva e 70 con un’iniziativa in progettazione.</p> <div class="row mt-3 justify-content-center"> <div class="col-md-10"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_it-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_it-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_it-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_it.png" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Mappa dei comuni italiani con iniziative di rifugio climatico: 187 attive, 70 in progettazione" data-zoomable="" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <h2 id="i-luoghi">i luoghi</h2> <p>All’interno di queste iniziative abbiamo localizzato 1776 luoghi, inclusi i cold spot indicati da ATS/ASST in Lombardia.</p> <div class="row mt-3 justify-content-center"> <div class="col-md-10"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_it-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_it-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_it-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_it.png" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Mappa dei 1776 rifugi climatici in Italia, con i cold spot ATS/ASST in Lombardia" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <h2 id="contatti">contatti</h2> <p>Contattami (catarina.midoes@cmcc.it) per segnalare l’iniziativa del tuo comune o ricevere aggiornamenti sulla mappatura. Altri progetti: <a href="/climate-shelters/it/">rifugi climatici</a>.</p> </div> <div class="lang-en" lang="en"> <p>In collaboration with ANCI (Associazione Nazionale dei Comuni Italiani), we are mapping climate shelter initiatives in Italian municipalities, combining a search of municipal websites with a survey.</p> <h2 id="the-municipalities">the municipalities</h2> <p>So far we have identified 187 municipalities with an active climate shelter initiative and 70 with one in planning.</p> <div class="row mt-3 justify-content-center"> <div class="col-md-10"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_en-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_en-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_en-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/comuni_en.png" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Map of Italian municipalities with climate shelter initiatives: 187 active, 70 in planning" data-zoomable="" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <h2 id="the-places">the places</h2> <p>Within these initiatives we have located 1776 places, including the cold spots designated by ATS/ASST in Lombardy.</p> <div class="row mt-3 justify-content-center"> <div class="col-md-10"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_en-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_en-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_en-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/rifugi-climatici/luoghi_en.png" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Map of 1776 climate shelters in Italy, with ATS/ASST cold spots in Lombardy" data-zoomable="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <h2 id="contact">contact</h2> <p>Get in touch (catarina.midoes@cmcc.it) to tell us about your municipality’s initiative or to receive updates on the mapping. More projects: <a href="/climate-shelters/">climate shelters</a>.</p> </div> <script>
  (function () {
    var titles = { it: "mappatura dei rifugi climatici in Italia", en: "mapping climate shelters in Italy" };
    var root = document.documentElement;
    function setLang(lang, save) {
      root.setAttribute("data-lang", lang);
      document.querySelectorAll("[data-set-lang]").forEach(function (b) {
        b.setAttribute("aria-pressed", b.getAttribute("data-set-lang") === lang ? "true" : "false");
      });
      var h1 = document.querySelector(".post-title");
      if (h1) h1.textContent = titles[lang];
      document.title = document.title.replace(/^[^|]*/, titles[lang] + " ");
      if (save) {
        try { localStorage.setItem("post-lang", lang); } catch (e) {}
        try { history.replaceState(null, "", "?lang=" + lang); } catch (e) {}
      }
    }
    var fromUrl = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get("lang");
    var saved = null;
    try { saved = localStorage.getItem("post-lang"); } catch (e) {}
    var browser = (navigator.language || "").toLowerCase().indexOf("it") === 0 ? "it" : "en";
    var lang = fromUrl === "it" || fromUrl === "en" ? fromUrl : saved === "it" || saved === "en" ? saved : browser;
    setLang(lang, false);
    document.querySelectorAll("[data-set-lang]").forEach(function (b) {
      b.addEventListener("click", function () { setLang(b.getAttribute("data-set-lang"), true); });
    });
  })();
</script>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="climate-shelters"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[187 comuni con un'iniziativa attiva, 70 in progettazione, 1776 luoghi · 187 municipalities with an active initiative, 70 in planning, 1776 places]]></summary></entry></feed>